Task: Fix {{task}} replacement when placeholder is wrapped in single quotes

Summary:
- Add coverage for templates that wrap {{task}} in single quotes.
- Replace quoted placeholder as a unit so escaping remains valid.
- Use function-based replacements to avoid replacement-string interpolation.

Files:
- src/main/agent-execution.ts
- src/main/agent-execution.test.ts

Why:
Single-quoted templates were leaving the injected task text unquoted, causing bash syntax errors for titles containing parentheses or quotes.
